Package: sensor-hub
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, adduser
Maintainer: Aleksandr Albekov <bulbashenko69@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/bulbashenko/pet-devops
Description: Simulated sensor telemetry HTTP daemon
 sensor-hub exposes deterministic, seeded sensor telemetry over a small REST
 API (/healthz, /api/v1/readings, /api/v1/stats). It exists to give a build,
 packaging and deployment pipeline something realistic to carry end to end.
 .
 The companion command line client is packaged separately as the Python
 distribution "sensorctl".
